    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d209-a1">

                <pb facs="0339" n="297" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg297"/>

                <head>Mr. Adams to Lord
                        Russell.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">London,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-05-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >May</hi> 16, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have the honor to transmit to you
                    copies of two depositions, going further to show the character and purposes of
                    the steamer Phantom, concerning which I have already made some representations
                    in my note to your lordship of the 26th of March, not doubting that these
                    proceedings have already attracted the attention of her Majesty’s
                    government.</p>
                <p>I pray, &amp;c., &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>CHARLES FRANCIS ADAMS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Earl Russell</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>




                <xi:include href="d209-a1-a1.xml" xpointer="d209-a1-a1"/>
